      "new_utf8": "\"\"\"Prospective dedicated StageC MAIN: one private five-seed constructor language.\nOriginal v1 four-endpoint suite stays immutable/incomplete; no six-case rerun.\nAll later checks/assertions/native20 remain; no fit or combined qualification.\n",
      "old_end": 249,
      "old_start": 0,
      "old_utf8": "\"\"\"Prospective StageC: original-language global priorities and complete-degree transfer.\nFour distinct cold purpose modes, each original20; all9 essential cases required.\nOnly declared actual-child interruption and NONLOGICAL scheduler calibration.\n"
    },
    {
